ce of death.\n\t\tFor %d turns afterwards you can instantly and accurately teleport to it (if it is in sight).\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每当你或你的随从杀死一个生物，你可以创建一个通向它死亡的地方的临时通道。\n\t\t %d 回合内，你可以瞬间、准确地传送到视野内的那个位置。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3dbca6137670ff6cd12e1367dc87fc607f17753a3910726a370a9f0d5e8844d6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3653c828c8864fead117af335a15969a00baa9edcee261291c73def7ede1301","logical_entry_identity":"ea1b360f9283f43d2d962bb12d48fe084af32b78bafd0614ee6d944cf72c15ae","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You fire a pinning shot, doing %d%% damage and pinning your target to the ground for %d turns.\n\t\tThe pinning chance increases with your Dexterity.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你射出定身一箭，造成 %d%% 伤害，并定身目标 %d 回合。\n\t\t定身几率受敏捷加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a6b3670a54324a155aa7bb1831e2cb5d4d774dd30d1b54d611da40d747b8e5de","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a369a14cc5aa0a91a8161b6fc3f08584853729ce8e7d1d165c6fd5f7f919ba65","logical_entry_identity":"9d54ae396fd59ea9cd8908efda24193359e854c38ceb752ba60d594511616a8c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"generic inc damage darkness","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通用 增加暗影伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b6e6606b0f2bec128d6ec8ebf9bd7900ea7b8b61eab3170b41275853128eab31","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3737f47786c9cf0f647966462c06a235024fb971bfe63cfd88f28237158f2ae","logical_entry_identity":"278a8650d92e2f41256d03913154a18e985931516b93388b24f5fad3a33d16ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#AQUAMARINE#All around you there is only water as far as you can see, except to your left, a giant coral structure. This is probably the temple of Creation.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#AQUAMARINE#在你四周除了水你看到的还是水，除了在你的左边，你看到一个巨大的珊瑚礁建筑，有可能这就是造物者神庙。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eacdca66ae07e5c4bd3dc72cc864270e9c54c7023a118c92e63870848df42eb8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3742ad2aa07cac85f6eb50af85725d4a12f0aaecb1bed5f4efbb06639c903de","logical_entry_identity":"945dabc580efa80734b02b2287cc969445778b07fe15eef7374e6b656a60b1ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You are able to perform usually unstealthy actions (attacking, using objects, ...) without breaking stealth.\t When you perform such an action while stealthed, you have a chance to stay hidden.\n\t\tSuccess is more likely against fewer opponents and is determined by comparing %0.2f times your stealth power (currently %d) to the stealth detection (reduced by 10%% per tile distance) of all enemies that have a clear line of sight to you.\n\t\tYour base chance of success is 100%% if you are not directly observed, and good or bad luck may also affect it.\n\t\tYou estimate your current chance to maintain stealth as %0.1f%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你学会在潜行状态下使用一些通常会打破潜行的技能（如攻击，使用物品……）当你在隐身状态下这么做的时候，你有一定概率不会打破潜行状态。\n\t\t你的成功率取决于你潜行强度的%0.2f倍（当前值 %d），以及所有视线能及你的敌人的侦测潜行能力（离你距离每有一格则下降10%%）。\n\t\t当你不在敌人的视野内时，基础成功率为 100%%，这一几率还受你的运气影响。\n\t\t你估计当前成功率为 %0.1f%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2c2e19f989101b57ce1c8356418b72c57699e0be60a012f143b84ecd7bcd9fb1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a37b5cd7ef575afd80dc1833f212026a6db62166a4aa4fa9f134d577399ef910","logical_entry_identity":"67c44160a823a5ce33264ac3403300f6c80fe2e2022445f1c6087c4188aece76","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Collection of known traps.","source_tag":"_t","target":"学会制造各种功能的陷阱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e39801c3bf662fb42f5925c4ca243a5e6494784afd6bdce8f33ab3cfa6bd49cb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a37ced311357ae9fcade93667fec33cdf176523badfa0886e4cb034e94bd5859","logical_entry_identity":"f474f7338ac0a362c46a17a1d76374a86cf56908994795558fa844abdc1062be","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\"The Spellblaze tore Eyal apart and nearly brought about the end of all civilisation. Two thousand years on its shadow still hangs over many lands, and the prideful mages have never been forgiven their place in bringing it about.","source_tag":"init.lua load_tips","target":"魔法大爆炸撕裂了埃亚尔大陆，整个文明差点被彻底摧毁。两千年岁月已过，爆炸的阴影依然笼罩着很多地区。那些高傲法师们铸成的大错令人们永生难忘。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4433bb3ec7e1914c99b65458b4eb6350a7709de3284f304f43af9299685292ea","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a37e5017cf7ae395f13ec9663e19ac11a9b12d57ae5bcf47ce8dd8ee7a241dfd","logical_entry_identity":"0231bda02704e03f411be87c9edc1ce17b0239bb40837ecd28f1424fb10f5b66","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Displaying creatures.","source_tag":"log","target":"显示生物。"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}}